WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Sign in. Open My analyses, then select New Analysis.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Enter a name you can find again later.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose one shared line or a separate line at each counter.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
After naming the analysis and choosing a line, select Continue to queue setup.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Choose Customer events or Totals and rates to match your records.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Download the XLSX or CSV template.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Fill in the template with your records. Keep the column names.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Select Use for planning for your plans, simulations and checks.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Choose the file, then select Upload and process.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Check any file review before you confirm. Fix errors and upload again.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Check that NovaQ read your data and setup correctly.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:32.000
If setup is incomplete, fill in the missing fields and select Save.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Open Analysis results. Check the analysis and file you are viewing.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Recorded wait comes from your records. Estimated wait comes from the model.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Open Suggested plans and check the source file.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Check the target, counter limits and costs before you run.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Select Optimize. Read the result and any warning.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Enter a plan name. Select Use this plan.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Save without using keeps the plan but does not select it.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Open Queue simulation. Select Suggested plan to test the selected plan.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Read whether the run covers the whole day or one period at a time.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:50.000
For a shared-line full-day run, check the rule for closing time.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:58.000
Start the run and wait for Done. Read any warning before you continue.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:06.000
Read the wait, longest line, customers served and closing-time result.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:14.000
Open Replay. Use Play and Pause to watch the saved run.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:21.000
Open Checks and decision for the selected plan.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:29.000
Select Check the plan. Wait for the required checks to finish.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:37.000
Read the Decision and its reason. Revise means change the plan first.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:45.000
Open Reports. Check the plan name and Decision before downloading.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:52.000
Select Download PDF for a summary of the results.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:59.000
Select Download Excel for the inputs and calculation details.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Use Your data only when you need a file without a plan report.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:15.000
Open the downloaded file. Check that it contains the results you need.
